{"repo": {"timestamp": 1790953424000, "version": 20002, "name": "paxel's apps", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://paxel.github.io/fdroid/repo", "description": "Releases of paxel's Android apps."}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"categories": ["channel"], "suggestedVersionCode": "2147483647", "license": "Unknown", "name": "catlog", "added": 1790836868000, "packageName": "io.github.paxel.catlog", "lastUpdated": 1790836868000}, {"authorEmail": "taum@tuta.io", "authorName": "paxel", "categories": ["Time"], "changelog": "https://github.com/paxel/chaos-alert/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md", "suggestedVersionCode": "2002", "donate": "https://ko-fi.com/paxel7", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/paxel/chaos-alert/issues", "license": "Apache-2.0 OR MIT", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/paxel/chaos-alert", "webSite": "https://github.com/paxel/chaos-alert", "added": 1790953422000, "packageName": "io.github.paxel.chaos_alert", "lastUpdated": 1790953423000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "Your alarm always sounds the same, so you sleep right through it. And \"just ten more minutes\" on the sofa turns into midnight again.\n\nchaos-alert nags you to bed when it's time, gives you one word to remember, and wakes you with a sound you never hear coming. To turn the alarm off, you pick last night's word from four. A wrong pick only snoozes it, and the app keeps count of how well you remembered.\n\n<b>What it does</b>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Bedtime nag</b> \u2014 at bedtime a quiet full-screen popup asks: Are you in bed? Bedtime follows from tomorrow's first alarm and how much sleep you want. Not yet? Snooze 10 minutes, or 30 min, 1 h, 2 h when you're out. Fell asleep without answering? The popup's time counts as your bedtime and nothing wakes you.</li>\n<li><b>In bed early</b> \u2014 the main screen offers \"I'm in bed\" in the three hours before bedtime.</li>\n<li><b>A word for the night</b> \u2014 one less common English word, shown once.</li>\n<li><b>The chaos alarm</b> \u2014 every ring picks something random: an alarm sound, a notification sound or a song from your music. Quiet at first, louder after 10 seconds, a new surprise after every snooze.</li>\n<li><b>The quiz</b> \u2014 four words, one of them last night's. Tap to mark, then OK. A wrong word snoozes the alarm and drops out of the next try; the page after the right one shows how many tries it took, your streak and your last 30 nights. Five misses in a row bring a gentle hint.</li>\n<li><b>I'm awake</b> \u2014 up before the alarm? In the hour before it, a button and a silent notification take you to the quiz; the right word turns off that morning's alarms.</li>\n<li><b>Alarms</b> \u2014 repeating on weekdays or once on a date; reminder alarms that shouldn't move your bedtime simply get their wake-up switch turned off.</li>\n<li><b>Vacations</b> \u2014 enter the dates once; repeating alarms and the nag stay quiet, one-time alarms still ring.</li>\n<li><b>Time in bed</b> \u2014 a week or a month of bars, coloured by how the quiz went, with your average time in bed and average bedtime.</li>\n</ul>\n\nEverything stays on your phone: no account, no internet permission, no tracking. Free and open source.\n", "featureGraphic": "featureGraphic_gO7cRUuVwAF8SG6xP850s8XK4QeTS0rUV0AWP_hSdoc=.png", "icon": "icon_a3ykEtn6zk1sTFAC9BOI6Halo0w8Xnpoop7H1Yc8I3A=.png", "name": "chaos-alert", "phoneScreenshots": ["01-home.png", "02-nag.png", "03-word.png", "04-quiz.png", "05-failure.png", "06-alarms.png", "07-week.png", "08-month.png"], "summary": "Bedtime nag, a word to remember, and an alarm that never sounds the same", "whatsNew": "\u2022 \"I'm awake\" button on the main screen and a silent notification in the hour before the first wake-up alarm; the right word turns off that morning's wake-up alarms.\n\u2022 A wrong word now snoozes the alarm and drops out of the next try; only the right word turns the alarm off.\nAll changes: https://github.com/paxel/chaos-alert/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md\n"}}}], "packages": {"io.github.paxel.catlog": [{"added": 1790836868000, "apkName": "catlog-2.1.0-android-arm64-v8a.apk", "hash": "116e9a147bafa55722d03b30650b50f2f2f010fce19e722e6bec4ee1d97ced98", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a"], "packageName": "io.github.paxel.catlog", "sig": "3d2b78bead69e043505ab4da6d3a8aee", "signer": "c82244429913fc74cdcdb1b9f9c57b4af3353980d6edda4685971209dfe146e5", "size": 56277412, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE", null], ["android.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_STATE", null], ["android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.NEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES", null], ["android.permission.READ_CALENDAR", null], ["android.permission.WRITE_CALENDAR", null], ["android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.VIBRATE", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.CAMERA", null], ["android.permission.WAKE_LOCK", null], ["io.github.paxel.catlog.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION", null]], "versionCode": 2232, "versionName": "2.1.0"}, {"added": 1790836868000, "apkName": "catlog-2.1.0-android-armeabi-v7a.apk", "hash": "ef71b683d70ce6020d36f3bd65ecb225d1314ed1ea38cc0cc453f08a563a0f83", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["armeabi-v7a"], "packageName": "io.github.paxel.catlog", "sig": "3d2b78bead69e043505ab4da6d3a8aee", "signer": "c82244429913fc74cdcdb1b9f9c57b4af3353980d6edda4685971209dfe146e5", "size": 49509400, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE", null], ["android.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_STA